Package: lumo-store
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, packagekit, packagekit-tools,
 appstream, lumo-theme, polkitd, pkexec
Description: Lumo OS software center
 Real, lightweight software center for Lumo OS: browses Debian AppStream
 catalogs, installs/removes/updates packages through PackageKit, shows
 pending updates, detects missing firmware and recommends drivers, and
 includes a gaming section (Steam, Wine, GameMode, MangoHud, controller
 tools). No fake buttons - every action drives the package system.
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
